    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Galleria bag draws inspiration from the layered structures and artisanal craftsmanship of the Fall/Winter 2026 runway. Using a Devoré burnout technique, it fuses distressed nappa lambskin with houndstooth wool, mimicking the natural wear-and-tear of a beloved item that reveals its lining over time. This ingenious design lends a nostalgic filter to the bag.",
