    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Buckle bag welcomes a new small size this season, measuring 15x22x11 cm. It retains the iconic trapezoidal silhouette, tubular leather top handles, and wraparound belt design. Available in water-blue crocodile leather, black, and heather calfskin, it comes with a detachable shoulder strap for shoulder or crossbody wear. Its architectural shape exudes elegance and refinement.",
